Package: rrpplatform
Type: Package
Title: Internal Readmission Risk Pool Implementation
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Alex", "Zajichek", email = "alexzajichek@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("CentralStatz Statistical & Data Sciences LLC", role = "cph"))
Description: Establishes the main internal implementation package for the
    Readmission Risk Pool software and its one-way dependency on the focused
    runtime package. It opens validated installed-resource catalogs from an
    explicit software root, resolves declared resources by logical identity,
    reports resource validation through a common privacy-safe result,
    normalizes installed canonical and singular target/state authority into
    exact runtime contexts, loads one explicit independent project through strict
    project-manifest and trusted-registration boundaries, executes its exact
    selected producer through a closed request/result boundary, delegates
    successful canonical admission to the runtime package, transactionally
    initializes the smallest valid project, and reports bounded operation
    results.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/centralstatz/readmission-risk-pool-platform
BugReports: https://github.com/centralstatz/readmission-risk-pool-platform/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: rrpruntime
